<entry><id>https://whysfoxes.github.io/whysfoxes_web/entries/243-nickschwaderer/</id><title>Page 243 by Nick Schwaderer</title><link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="https://whysfoxes.github.io/whysfoxes_web/entries/243-nickschwaderer/"/><updated>2026-10-09T00:16:19.085Z</updated><author><name>Nick Schwaderer</name></author><content type="html">&lt;p&gt;The goalie sat down — the lemonade stand was bankrupt. &amp;quot;Don&amp;apos;t worry&amp;quot; the goalie said. Lemonade is a SCAM these days. You would be better off marketing a new Claude Code extension. Or be like me. I have learned to be a friend to myself. The ball went in the net.&lt;br/&gt;Schwad&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://whysfoxes.github.io/whysfoxes_web/_astro/117408049395685763.CdzAyCbZ_ZpOD4.jpeg&quot;&gt;The scan&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</content></entry>
